  "reductionNotes": "S1 battle viewport (sky, tree, log, props, ground, grass) plus S7 floating damage numbers (individual damage numbers never become elements) -> S1 main-scene; S6 enemy group -> S2 character; S5 party with its slash FX and skateboard -> S3 character (union incl. the FX to x 46.8); S3 stage HUD -> S4 hud and S2 player HUD -> S5 hud (both top-level, kept apart; S4 comes first because it starts 0.1 higher); S4 equipment column -> S6 panel. Marketing: M1 card margin + white outline + the second outline tilted ~1.5 deg -> M1 frame at 0 deg (the tilt belongs to a decorative child); M7 blurred bokeh foreground (three patches) -> M2 'other' (no vocab role fits a blurred foreground; closest alternatives band/backdrop); M4 cat + M4.1 halo -> M3 cut-out; M2 headline -> M4; M3 pill + text + icon -> M5 subline; M5 knight -> M6 cut-out; M6 chick -> M7 cut-out. Headline glyph fill box (13.3% tall) is not a cap height, so headlineGlyphPercent stays null."
